      "comment": "ROCKNROLL SPIRIT (3) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 5.5 metres from the winner in fifth over 1800m at this track. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Finds a suitable assignment and can turn things around. UPRIGHT (4) was in the money at Port Pirie two runs ago before having his colours lowered at his latest appearance over 1800m at this track, beaten 7 metres. Tackles a similar assignment and he can turn in a much better performance. GLITZY ALL OVER (2) is on the radar after her last-start fourth over 2070m at Gawler two weeks ago. BETTOR LOVER NZ (5) is worth some thought despite his last-start eighth over 2050m at Port Pirie on September 21.",
